Data source
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The data used for training and evaluation derives from information published
by Japan's National Tax Agency on the Corporate Number Publication Site.

    Source: National Tax Agency Corporate Number Publication Site (NTA)
    https://www.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp/
    Created by processing that data.

The published information may be used under terms conforming to the Japanese
Government's Public Data License (Version 1.0), which requires crediting the
source and stating that the data has been modified.
Current terms: https://www.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp/pc/riyokiyaku/

This repository does not redistribute the NTA raw data. Fetch it yourself with
scripts/fetch_houjin.py.

